          "width": "330.0px",
          "height": "250.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<h2 style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif; color: #d4af37; font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 15px 0;'>A Tradition of Excellence</h2><p style='color: #ddd; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;'>At St. Jude's, we nurture the leaders of tomorrow through rigorous academics, character development, and a commitment to service. Our historic campus provides an inspiring environment where intellectual curiosity flourishes.</p>",
